Buying a beat on Beat22 is super simple. Here’s exactly how it works:

### **Step-by-Step guide:**

**1\. Choose Your Beat** Browse the Beat22 library and find the beat you like. **2\. Click the Price Button** Once you’ve decided, click the **price button** shown on the beat. This is also the **"Buy" button**.

![1\. Choose Your Beat Browse the Beat22 library and find the beat you like. 2\. Click the Price Button Once](/images/2025/07/Screenshot-2025-07-01-132221.png)

**3\. Select your license type** After clicking, you’ll be shown three options:

-   **WAV (MP3 + WAV files)**
-   **WAV + Stems (Full project-ready files)**
-   **Exclusive License (One-time, you own it)**

Click the price again under your preferred option.

![Click the price again under your preferred option.](/images/2025/07/Screenshot-2025-07-01-132242.png)

**4\. Beat added to cart** Once clicked, your beat is added to the cart automatically. **5\. Go to cart & apply coupons** Head over to the cart. If any valid **coupon** is active, it’ll be applied automatically.

![4\. Beat added to cart Once clicked, your beat is added to the cart automatically. 5\. Go to cart & apply](/images/2025/07/Screenshot-2025-07-01-132302.png)

**6\. Checkout with your preferred payment method** Beat22 supports:

-   **UPI, Cards, Wallets, Net Banking** (India)
-   **PayPal & International Cards** (Global)
    
    ![PayPal & International Cards (Global)](/images/2025/07/Screenshot-2026-02-14-142935-1.png)
    

Make the payment and you’re done!

## **Learn how to get beats after purchase: [Click here](/2025/07/07/how-can-i-download-my-purchased-beats/)**

-    Please click on “**Browse**” in the menu section
-   Then click on “**Your Orders**”
-   Now open the order, which contains the desired beat
-   Click the down arrow under “Actions” to download the beat files, or the down arrow under “License” to download the license document.
-   You also get a copy of everything in your **email**.
    
    ![You also get a copy of everything in your email.](/images/2025/07/Screenshot-2026-02-14-150018.png)
    

**Now you’re all set to record and release your song.** Got questions? Reach out at support@beat22.com anytime!
